    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to Chirpvenience!</i> is a short, heartwarming visual novel filled with cheerful moments.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the quaint and peaceful town of <strong>Lark</strong>\u00a0<strong>Town</strong> as a temporary clerk at the local convenience store. Over the course of one week, you\u2019ll meet a colorful cast of customers and coworkers, experiencing humor, warmth, and small surprises in everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stress-Free</strong> \u2013 Simple controls and a gentle pace make it easy for anyone to enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the story\u2019s path, though all roads lead to the one true ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chirp-pedia</strong> \u2013 Collect fun and quirky items during your shifts and unlock the town\u2019s little stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Horror Elements</strong> \u2013 A warm, humorous, and cozy atmosphere from start to finish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a break, step into Lochar Town, and enjoy your special week at Chirpvenience!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to Chirpvenience!</i> is a short, heartwarming visual novel filled with cheerful moments.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the quaint and peaceful town of <strong>Lark</strong>\u00a0<strong>Town</strong> as a temporary clerk at the local convenience store. Over the course of one week, you\u2019ll meet a colorful cast of customers and coworkers, experiencing humor, warmth, and small surprises in everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stress-Free</strong> \u2013 Simple controls and a gentle pace make it easy for anyone to enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the story\u2019s path, though all roads lead to the one true ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chirp-pedia</strong> \u2013 Collect fun and quirky items during your shifts and unlock the town\u2019s little stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Horror Elements</strong> \u2013 A warm, humorous, and cozy atmosphere from start to finish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a break, step into Lochar Town, and enjoy your special week at Chirpvenience!</strong></p>",
